tion is\n\n$$\ny(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{-9}+{c}_{2}{x}^{-9}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-64785/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3abe724a-6aec-5c11-8a00-d92e616a06d7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-64785"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872/selection/678c4f1b1e14d3ec7a3ddcaf398eaaebd773b4dc1f1a8a7af88401d0ffdce90c" :answer/id #uuid "a42cbb48-3734-5e9d-a87b-e0729fc5c2b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-2}+{c}_{2}{t}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872/selection/64045fc9dff64ac82577690e3ff6568cf54086c421085dda19596fa09908b658" :answer/id #uuid "7b415066-80fb-5d6e-bd2f-e5ab2cee989c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-2}+{c}_{2}{t}^{-2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872/selection/5f4ccae2d399311b474c1a904bc740411f0856666c19e05500a8fb21e573041d" :answer/id #uuid "5ae9e3ad-3b91-5ae3-bdae-52c0f259c06f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-1}+{c}_{2}{t}^{-1}\\operatorname{ln}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872/selection/7c1b9cb1c42ca99dff95dbb5951f7fa61e73ac5e31a615b58723bbf267063617" :answer/id #uuid "d102e145-b174-586c-bb72-1ca00f4ba8d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y(t)={c}_{1}t+{c}_{2}t\\operatorname{ln}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872/selection/d9b01cfa62e623289013e7bfeb96f12efb0cb886e925f2028db98dcdf3645df7" :answer/id #uuid "5a912bae-9cdb-5869-a331-da53947f9b5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y(t)={c}_{1}t+{c}_{2}{t}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d1c3b756-b8fa-598b-b22d-2751047099c5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-64872/selection/64045fc9dff64ac82577690e3ff6568cf54086c421085dda19596fa09908b658" :answer-field/choices ["q-64872/selection/678c4f1b1e14d3ec7a3ddcaf398eaaebd773b4dc1f1a8a7af88401d0ffdce90c" "q-64872/selection/64045fc9dff64ac82577690e3ff6568cf54086c421085dda19596fa09908b658" "q-64872/selection/5f4ccae2d399311b474c1a904bc740411f0856666c19e05500a8fb21e573041d" "q-64872/selection/7c1b9cb1c42ca99dff95dbb5951f7fa61e73ac5e31a615b58723bbf267063617" "q-64872/selection/d9b01cfa62e623289013e7bfeb96f12efb0cb886e925f2028db98dcdf3645df7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-64872" :question/id #uuid "437b3f00-7c42-52b5-95e9-666d55baf0bf" :question/math-academy-id "q-64872" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the equation\n\n$$\n2{t}^{2}{y}^{″}+10t{y}^{′}+8y=0,\\,t>0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The given equation is an instance of the Cauchy-Euler equation. So, we assume that the solutions take the form $y={t}^{\\lambda }.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $t$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {t}^{\\lambda -1},\\,{y}^{″}=\\lambda (\\lambda -1){t}^{\\lambda -2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above to our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{t}^{2}\\cdot \\lambda (\\lambda -1){t}^{\\lambda -2}+10t\\cdot \\lambda {t}^{\\lambda -1}+8{t}^{\\lambda } & =0 \\\\ 2\\lambda (\\lambda -1){t}^{\\lambda }+10\\lambda {t}^{\\lambda }+8{t}^{\\lambda } & =0 \\\\ {t}^{\\lambda }[2\\lambda (\\lambda -1)+10\\lambda +8] & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the auxiliary equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\lambda (\\lambda -1)+10\\lambda +8 & =0 \\\\ 2{\\lambda }^{2}+8\\lambda +8 & =0 \\\\ 2({\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +4) & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +2)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we have a double root $\\lambda =-2.$\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\ny(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-2}+{c}_{2}{t}^{-2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-64872/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3abe724a-6aec-5c11-8a00-d92e616a06d7"] :knowledge-poin